PRO-FORMA FIRST RESOLUTION OF THE GENERAL PARTNER

WHEREAS the formation of the Limited Partnership is necessary for the assembly and calibration of electronic patient monitoring devices;

RESOLVED that the General Partner subscribes to the initial limited partnership interest in the capital of the Partnership in the amount of One Dollar ($1.00);

RESOLVED that the registered office of the Limited Partnership shall be at [Insert Full Address], Ontario, Canada;

RESOLVED that [Full Name of General Partner] is appointed as the sole General Partner with full management authority;

RESOLVED that [Officer Name 1], [Officer Name 2], and [Officer Name 3] are appointed as officers with titles President, Secretary, and Treasurer respectively;

RESOLVED FURTHER that the General Partner is authorized to execute all necessary documents for incorporation and operations.

This resolution is passed on [Date].
